`sysmon` EventCode=1 ParentImage="*\\regsvr32.exe" Image="*\\rundll32.exe"
| stats count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen by ComputerName, Image, ParentImage, CommandLine
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)

```
Emotet Execution Chain: regsvr32 Spawning rundll32
Author: fungiknight (Gabriel Lopez)
MITRE: T1218.010, T1218.011

Emotet DLLs are registered via regsvr32 which then spawns
rundll32 to load the payload. This parent-child relationship
is unusual in legitimate software.
